{"slug":"international-traveller","title":"International Traveller","desc":"Keep international travellers safe in an emergency with an SOS alarm and by locating & communicating with them using Peoplesafe 2-way crisis communication.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"International Travel Personal Safety\",\"title\":\"International Traveller\",\"intro\":\"Keep international travellers safe in an emergency by locating and communicating with them while they’re overseas using a two-way crisis communication platform.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"SOC integration\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/SOC-integration.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"\",\"heading\":\"SOC integration\",\"content\":\"Security teams can see and respond to an emerging crisis or SOS alarm in seconds.\",\"linkText\":\"Read product brochure\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/International-Traveler-flyer-Final-1.pdf\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Discreet alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/discreet.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Don't raise suspicions\",\"heading\":\"Discreet alarm\",\"content\":\"Avoid escalating situations by raising an alarm without using the SOS button by pressing the power button or shaking the mobile device.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/International-Traveler-flyer-Final-1.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Geofence\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/geofence-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Targeted communications\",\"heading\":\"Geofence\",\"content\":\"Communicate with people in a specific location immediately.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/International-Traveler-flyer-Final-1.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Incident Management\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/incident-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"\",\"heading\":\"Incident Management\",\"content\":\"Effectively deal with a crisis with communication audits to see who has read and responded to critical messages.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/International-Traveler-flyer-Final-1.pdf\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"SOS alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Help available 24/7\",\"heading\":\"SOS alarm\",\"content\":\"Receive emergency help faster than 999 with direct access to police control rooms.\",\"linkText\":\"Read more\",\"link\":\"/uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/International-Traveler-flyer-Final-1.pdf%20\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/international-traveller-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Dynamic incident management\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/iStock-944279456.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Protect your overseas travellers in a crisis with Peoplesafe’s International Traveller service, making it easier for managers or SOC to locate and communicate with employees abroad during critical events like terror attacks or extreme weather.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Integrate your security team’s international escalation procedures into our portal to improve situational awareness and location of staff.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Warn and inform staff in specific locations when a crisis happens and ensure that they have the information they need to get to safety through our critical communication platform. Every communication is recorded, so that you can see who has seen and responded to vital messages and can manage risk at a distance more effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Dedicated 24/7 alarm response\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/fullsizeoutput_6ee8-scaled-e1645455506225-1024x614.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Overseas travellers can raise an alarm if they feel threatened, unsafe or unwell wherever they are, whenever they need support. Alarms can be raised discreetly either by shaking the smartphone or pressing the power/lock button.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you choose to use our ARC, then all alarms are recorded, received and triaged by the Peoplesafe <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a> before being passed to a security team or SOC. Security teams will benefit from a reduction in false alarms as well as receiving all the key information from an expertly trained alarm handler.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Security teams will have access to interactive maps on our portal that display any SOS alarms as they happen. It will also show pins of other nearby users who may need to be contacted if an emergency situation is developing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Peoplesafe International Traveller service\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Paris_France_Geofence_Map.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The technology is packed with features including:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SOS alarm: staff can raise an alert when they feel unsafe</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Mass notification: send 2,000 messages per second</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Silent override: bypass Do Not Disturb and silent settings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We collect important user information during the onboarding of this service enabling us to respond rapidly in an emergency. When an alarm is raised we will know: who the user is, where they are, and the risks they face. Coupled with a standard escalation plan that is created during set up allows our service to deliver help and support as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For organisations without a SOC, we offer additional services in the form of <a href=\"/uk/products/eurowatch/\">Eurowatch</a> and <a href=\"/uk/products/global-response/\">Global Response</a> which can extend your alarm response capabilities to an international reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/16/3/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the International Traveler service can enhance the safety and security of your workers when they’re abroad?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how the International Traveler service provides reliable protection, rapid response, and incident management to ensure your employees outside the UK.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/16/3/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get an International Traveller demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-17/2jjfpr\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":15,"types":["emergency-notifications","safety-apps"]}